      "category_ids": [
        "letters"
      ],
      "note_bn": "রেস্টুরেন্টের সাইনে থাকে।",
      "note_en": "On restaurant signs."
    },
    {
      "id": "rd-l5-06",
      "type": "word",
      "arabic": "عصير",
      "bangla": "জুস",
      "english": "Juice",
      "bn_transliteration": "আসীর",
      "en_transliteration": "ʿaṣīr",
      "category_ids": [
        "letters"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "rd-l6-01",
      "type": "word",
      "arabic": "ف",
      "bangla": "উচ্চারণ: ফ",
      "english": "Sound: f",
      "bn_transliteration": "ফা",
      "en_transliteration": "fā",
      "category_ids": [
        "letters"
      ],
      "note_bn": "ওপরে এক ফোঁটা। শুরু, মাঝ ও শেষে: فـ ـفـ ـف।",
      "note_en": "One dot above. Start, middle, end: فـ ـفـ ـف."
    },
    {
      "id": "rd-l6-02",
      "type": "word",
      "arabic": "ق",
      "bangla": "উচ্চারণ: ক (গলার গভীর থেকে)",
      "english": "Sound: q, a deep k",
      "bn_transliteration": "ক্বাফ",
      "en_transliteration": "qāf",
      "category_ids": [
        "letters"
      ],
      "note_bn": "ওপরে দুই ফোঁটা। সৌদি কথায় প্রায়ই 'গ' শোনায়। শুরু, মাঝ ও শেষে: قـ ـقـ ـق।",
      "note_en": "Two dots above. Often sounds like g in Saudi speech. Start, middle, end: قـ ـقـ ـق."
    },
    {
